1. An apparatus comprising:

a multilayer electronic display having a viewing side and a second side opposite the viewing side;

a light source positioned to emit light from the second side toward the viewing side;

a plurality of color subpixels arranged in a display area, each color subpixel configured to transmit a corresponding color component of the light; and

a plurality of subpixel shutters disposed in optical alignment with the plurality of color subpixels between the second side and the viewing side,

wherein each subpixel shutter is independently controllable to selectively permit or inhibit passage of the light through a corresponding color subpixel toward the viewing side.
